	(text "Controls and LEDs. Six B10K pots on the Relic/Alchemist grid (rows +38 / +13, columns -20 / 0 / +20) across +3V3, wipers to ADC1 PA0-PA5 through 1k / 100n.\nThree SPDT toggles (row -5) pull PE12-PE14 to ground; internal pull-ups. Twelve 0603 note LEDs, C to B, on PD0-PD11 (one port write), 1k each, behind 3 mm light pipes at face Y -18."
